    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One swing. One cut. One endless harvest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Reap, the most relaxing (or obsessive?) game about cutting grass you\u2019ll ever play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve through endless fields and watch the grass explode into glorious coin showers. The more you reap, the richer you get\u2014simple as that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s the Deal?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-button gameplay \u2013 Tap. Swing. Cut. It\u2019s that easy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless reaping \u2013 The grass never stops growing, and you never stop cutting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins, coins, coins! \u2013 Grass drops nothing but pure, shiny currency. The rarer the coin, the harder it is to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare finds \u2013 Every now and then, a new ultra-rare coin is added.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slice. Collect. Repeat. How deep will you reap?</p>",
